<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 75 0 R
/T (Q5. Explain the purpose of filters, slicers, and drill-down functionality in dashboards.)
/E (Q5. Explain the purpose of filters, slicers, and drill-down functionality in dashboards.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 75 0 R
/T (Filters and slicers let users narrow down the displayed data to a specific subset \(e.g., only "West" region or a particular date range\) without altering the underlying dataset, making analysis more focused and relevant. Drill-down functionality allows users to move from a summary level \(e.g., yearly sales\) to more granular detail \(e.g., monthly, then daily sales\) within the same visual, enabling deeper investigation of specific trends or anomalies.)
/E (Filters and slicers let users narrow down the displayed data to a specific subset \(e.g., only "West" region or a particular date range\) without altering the underlying dataset, making analysis more focused and relevant. Drill-down functionality allows users to move from a summary level \(e.g., yearly sales\) to more granular detail \(e.g., monthly, then daily sales\) within the same visual, enabling deeper investigation of specific trends or anomalies.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
468 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 75 0 R
/T (Q6. What factors should be considered while designing an effective business dashboard?)
/E (Q6. What factors should be considered while designing an effective business dashboard?)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 75 0 R
/T (Key factors include: identifying the target audience and their specific needs, choosing the right KPIs and visuals for the objective, maintaining a clean and uncluttered layout, ensuring consistent color schemes and formatting, prioritizing the most important metrics at the top, using appropriate chart types for the data, and testing interactivity \(filters, drill-downs\) for usability.)
/E (Key factors include: identifying the target audience and their specific needs, choosing the right KPIs and visuals for the objective, maintaining a clean and uncluttered layout, ensuring consistent color schemes and formatting, prioritizing the most important metrics at the top, using appropriate chart types for the data, and testing interactivity \(filters, drill-downs\) for usability.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
